  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is a vector such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math> and the angle between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math> is:"
